# SME-Digital UZ

A website project that helps small local businesses in Uzbekistan get online with ready-made, affordable website templates, so owners can publish their services and contacts without writing code.

**Live site:** https://abduhalim72.github.io/sme-digital-uz/

## Status
Work in progress. The landing page is online, and one sample template (shop) is built. More templates are planned.

## How it works
Each business page is generated from a single data file (`data.js`). The owner only edits this file, and the page updates automatically through JavaScript (`dokon.js`).

## Built with
HTML, CSS, JavaScript, GitHub Pages

